# No tests

Never run, modify, create, delete, or refactor tests in any way.

- Do not run `go test`, `./gradlew test`, or any other test command
- Do not edit `*_test.go`, `*Test.java`, `*Tests.kt`, or fixtures under `testdata/` / `__tests__/`
- Do not add assertions, mocks, or coverage for changes you make
- If a change would normally require updating a test, leave the test alone and only change production code
- Prefer verifying with builds, manual checks, or reading code — not the test suite
